OL,3,AImran Khan seeks urgent medical care
OL,4,Afearing he 'may not return alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPakistan's jailed former PM Imran Khan
OL,7,Fhas appealed for urgent medical
OL,8,Ftreatment, saying that his and his
OL,9,Fwife's health has been deteriorating.
OL,11,F"At 74, this unrelenting state is
OL,12,Ftaking me to a place from which I may
OL,13,Fnot return alive," the cricket
OL,14,Fstar-turned-politician wrote in a
OL,15,Fletter published by his lawyer Salman
OL,16,FSafdar.
OL,18,FAuthorities in Islamabad maintain that
OL,19,FKhan gets seen weekly by doctors, who
OL,20,Fhave assessed that he is of
OL,21,F"satisfactory" health.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
